<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79361" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρέμ-πτωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>influx, entrance</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ὑγροῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Resp.</u>
					476b8
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>occurrence</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				7.175
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>insertion</i> of words, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				16.11
			</span></i>,al.; <i>parenthesis</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Amm.</u>
				2.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>implication</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				202.6
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				203.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> Medic.,
				<i>transfusion</i> of blood into arteries, <i><span class="en">
				Erasistr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.542
			</span></i>, al., Id. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Anon.Lond.
				27.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Herod.Med.
			</span></i> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.Mus.</u>
				49.553
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.948c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>intercidence</i> of crisis, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				9.868
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b>
			<i>embolism of the retinal artery</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				14.777
			</span></i>.</div>
